{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n有靚酒當然唔少得美食，同場特設美食攤位，提供會場獨家口味小食，鐘意品酒嘅您一定唔可以錯過！\n</p>\n<p>⚡逾百款清酒陣容！<br/>\n現場酒款種類極之豐富，有超過100款清酒任你發掘！無論你係偏好果香微甜嘅清酒新手，定係鍾情醇厚口感嘅品資深酒迷，都可以喺度發掘到你嘅專屬口味～</p>\n<p>🍢 會場限定！4大獨家佐酒小食<br/>\n淨係飲酒點夠喉？現場特別設有 4 檔小食攤位，精心炮製咗專為今次活動「獨家製作」嘅佐酒小食🍴！每一款都係為咗完美配搭清酒而設，帶畀你味覺雙重享受！</p>\n<p>🎟️ 全場免費入場體驗<br/>\n今次活動免費入場，畀大家可以輕鬆地發掘清酒嘅魅力。快啲約埋酒肉朋友一齊去尋寶啦！</p>\n<p>「Sake Sparks!」⽇本清酒試飲販賣會🍶<br/>\n📅日期：2026年11月13至15日（星期五至日）</p>\n<p>🕘時間：中午12時至晚上9時<br/>\n📍地點：@popcorn.tko L1中庭, PopCorn 1</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318167186031393_14066146866ae1c7e831792.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318167186031393_14066146866ae1c7e831792.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfCD6Lpj4Ip/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T10:21:35.979369+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":440,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T10:01:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T11:58:49.637714+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T10:18:37.169084+00:00","content_hash":"7fce8293f3b9ea8bdfe9e6d998982fba6ee9b79ab4a254b2fb8cd0315509b969","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}